{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.sakuya.crowd",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "人潮里她找不到你",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.sakuya.crowd",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.sakuya.crowd",
    "idolId": "sakuya",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（人太多了，找不到应该在等我的咲耶……麻烦了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "制作人！太好了，我还以为这样下去就碰不上了。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊！咲、咲耶！找到你太好了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "抱歉，不知道是什么活动，没想到会有这么多人。",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样下去要迟到了。快走吧，咲耶。",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "好，知道了。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "不过真的好多的人啊。这样连走路都很难吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "唔，没办法了……",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "……诶？制作人？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "为什么、手……",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "走吧，先冲出人群！",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "……！好、好！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "呼……人总算少下来了。到这里应该没问题了。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "突然抓住你的手，抱歉。疼吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "……没、没事。只是突然被抓住手……吓了一跳而已。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "对、对不起……应该先跟你说一声的。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "クス……制作人也有相当强硬的一面呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "呐，制作人。我们现在，在旁人眼里是什么样子呢？",
        "choices": [
          { "label": "大小姐和她的随从吧。", "nextNodeId": "30" },
          { "label": "亲子？", "nextNodeId": "40" },
          { "label": "咲耶怎么想？", "nextNodeId": "50" }
        ]
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "……大小姐吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "クス……不坏呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "不过，制作人是随从，这可说不过去吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，对上咲耶，我只能看成那样。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "那是不是谦虚过头了？制作人也相当有看头哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "唔……是吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "フフ。何不多一点自信呢？不过，也是呢……",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "既然你说大小姐……那就机会难得，能把我送到会场吗，随从先生？",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……结果还是被她的步调带着走了。）"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "フフ。再怎么说，也不至于看起来差那么多岁吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈哈。确实也许是这样。那就是兄弟……不，年纪差得多的朋友更接近？唔……",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "真是的……アナタ真是一点都不懂女人心呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "什么意思？",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "那谁知道呢。不过……",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "那也算是制作人的优点吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "唔。完全听不懂。",
        "nextNodeId": "47"
      },
      "47": {
        "id": "47",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "是说你诚实。好了，走吧。我可不想迟到。"
      },
      "50": {
        "id": "50",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "咦？……フフ……原来如此。",
        "nextNodeId": "51"
      },
      "51": {
        "id": "51",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "我怎么会问出这么坏心眼的问题呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "52"
      },
      "52": {
        "id": "52",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "比起那个，咲耶，擦擦汗吧。明明工作前，还让你跑了，抱歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "53"
      },
      "53": {
        "id": "53",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "没事的，我运动很擅长。看起来那么不可靠吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "54"
      },
      "54": {
        "id": "54",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，没有那回事。我是信赖咲耶的。",
        "nextNodeId": "55"
      },
      "55": {
        "id": "55",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "但是，把偶像以最好的状态送到现场，才是制作人的工作。",
        "nextNodeId": "56"
      },
      "56": {
        "id": "56",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "クス。还是一样热爱工作呢。能被アナタ带着，我是个幸运的人。",
        "nextNodeId": "57"
      },
      "57": {
        "id": "57",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "制作人和偶像…………嗯，这就是我们现在最好的关系。",
        "nextNodeId": "58"
      },
      "58": {
        "id": "58",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是啊。那么，走吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "59"
      },
      "59": {
        "id": "59",
        "speakerId": "sakuya",
        "text": "呐，制作人……",
        "nextNodeId": "60"
      },
      "60": {
        "id": "60",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？怎么了？"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
